  (text "CAN A / CAN B - DEVELOPMENT INTERFACES"
    (at 25.4 15.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "26d9b611-a129-4d91-b70b-69137ccf7891")
  )
  (text "J2/J3 are logical subsets, not physical stack connectors.\nJ2: 1 -> H1.51 CAN_H; 2 -> H1.52 CAN_L.\nJ3: 1 -> H2.49 CAN_B_H; 2 -> H2.50 CAN_B_L."
    (at 254 27.94 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9c7eb05b-4af5-4819-98a9-08f4a53dd3c6")
  )
  (text "R7/R8: DNP; fit 120 ohm only at actual bus ends.\nPower/package selection pending sustained differential fault budget.\nDNP is a custom field; native DNP-setting API is unavailable."
    (at 254 93.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "eedd8b45-1ca5-4ee0-91f1-b3d4dd379b4e")
  )
  (text "No external TVS selected; protection qualification remains open.\nNo A/B bus or termination midpoint connection."
    (at 254 129.54 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "d3e55393-a0f9-408b-ae71-fe3f45bbdc7e")
  )
  (text "FAULT LIMIT: shared +3V3, GND, MCU and clock remain common paths.\nPer-transceiver VCC/VIO + pullup branch limiting/isolation is unselected.\nCAN B is bus-path recovery, not independent controller/power redundancy."
    (at 25.4 213.36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "56efddb7-a8f7-448d-968a-0e273ea1cf61")
  )
  (text "Existing custom U2/U3 symbols and manufacturer land patterns reused.\nPin maps verified; assembly, ESD, timing and physical placement not qualified."
    (at 25.4 236.22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "40922108-96bd-4e9a-b337-b1dd1a0f9186")
  )
